{
  "summary": "The experiment tested the pca_n2000 RNA encoder in a multiprofile RNA-only model, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727, lower than the scvi_n200 baseline (0.6501 accuracy, 0.6275 F1). This suggests potential limitations of pca_n2000 compared to scvi_n200, but the exact contribution of the encoder choice versus other design elements remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

